# DVL – Smart Textile Performance Platform

DVL is an AI-powered smart textile platform designed for elite ice hockey players. The system combines wearable technology, embedded electronics, and artificial intelligence to collect, analyze, and visualize athlete performance data in real time.

This repository contains the official landing page built with Next.js and Tailwind CSS.

---

## Features

- Modern responsive landing page
- Hero section with immersive product showcase
- Problem & Solution presentation
- Smart textile technology overview
- AI analytics section
- Interactive dashboard showcase
- Roadmap and market sections
- Contact section
- Dark modern UI inspired by sports technology products

---

## Tech Stack

- Next.js 15
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion
- Lucide React

---

## Project Structure

```
app/
