    └── images/
```

---

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/kaandvloglu/DVL.git
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Run the development server:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open:

```
http://localhost:3000
```

---

## Build

Production build:

```bash
npm run build
```

